WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.400
Here's what done looks like.

2
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:04.673
Every app has two owners who
are real, enabled people,

3
00:00:04.673 --> 00:00:07.413
or a finding with someone
assigned to fix it.

4
00:00:07.413 --> 00:00:09.752
Every reference points at a live record,

5
00:00:09.752 --> 00:00:13.937
and every directory account has an
application owner or is a candidate.

6
00:00:13.937 --> 00:00:17.975
No orphan was disabled without the
governance officer's confirmation.

7
00:00:17.975 --> 00:00:22.487
The plan's hash was approved by someone
other than the person who applied it,

8
00:00:22.487 --> 00:00:25.762
the write ran as a person, and
every disable has its date.

9
00:00:25.762 --> 00:00:27.119
With owners in place,

10
00:00:27.119 --> 00:00:31.350
Chapter 3 turns each account's
candidate target into a decision.

11
00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:32.520
Thanks for watching.
